   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c25",
   "text": {
    "html": "<h2 class=\"pricing-h1 faq-h2\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>",
    "text": "Frequently Asked Questions"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c2c",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"faq-q-text\">Welke matcha grade is het beste voor cafés?</div>",
    "text": "Welke matcha grade is het beste voor cafés?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c2f",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"faq-answer-text\">Ceremonial and premium grades are most commonly used for lattes and iced drinks.</p>",
    "text": "Ceremonial and premium grades are most commonly used for lattes and iced drinks."
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c36",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"faq-q-text\"><strong data-w-id=\"02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c37\">Bieden jullie bio matcha aan?</strong></div>",
    "text": "Bieden jullie bio matcha aan?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c3a",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"faq-answer-text\">Ja, EU Bio (Skal NL-BIO-01) en USDA Organic gecertificeerde opties zijn beschikbaar.</p>",
    "text": "Ja, EU Bio (Skal NL-BIO-01) en USDA Organic gecertificeerde opties zijn beschikbaar."
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c41",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"faq-q-text\"><strong data-w-id=\"a1876ad2-e302-c8b9-220a-0d8a8e42730d\">Wat is de minimale bestelling voor cafés?</strong></div>",
    "text": "Wat is de minimale bestelling voor cafés?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c44",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"faq-answer-text\">Programs typically start at 100kg per year, scalable based on your needs.</p>",
    "text": "Programs typically start at 100kg per year, scalable based on your needs."
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c51",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"faq-q-text\"><strong data-w-id=\"1c30d662-92bf-4e4f-944d-31563ae474e3\">Leveren jullie ook buiten Nederland, bijvoorbeeld naar België of Duitsland?</strong></div>",
    "text": "Leveren jullie ook buiten Nederland, bijvoorbeeld naar België of Duitsland?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c54",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"faq-answer-text\">Yes, we regularly ship to North America and Europe with full documentation.</p>",
    "text": "Yes, we regularly ship to North America and Europe with full documentation."
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c5e",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"faq-q-text\"><strong data-w-id=\"b1c98fda-0a4e-4cbf-b039-5b8a962765b1\">Kunnen horecagroothandels ook partner worden?</strong></div>",
    "text": "Kunnen horecagroothandels ook partner worden?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c61",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"faq-answer-text\">Ja, wij werken samen met foodservice-groothandels en horecadistributeurs.</p>",
    "text": "Ja, wij werken samen met foodservice-groothandels en horecadistributeurs."
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "d79947c1-fb4d-6ffa-0322-4daae0922dec",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"faq-q-text\"><strong data-w-id=\"d79947c1-fb4d-6ffa-0322-4daae0922ded\">Kunnen jullie meerdere vestigingen of grotere horecagroepen bedienen?</strong></div>",
    "text": "Kunnen jullie meerdere vestigingen of grotere horecagroepen bedienen?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "d79947c1-fb4d-6ffa-0322-4daae0922df0",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"faq-answer-text\">Ja. Ons <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"698ed39e8999d2a9cf8e7e17\" data-w-id=\"c78c9096-00b1-dd25-c208-40a90a74ee38\">schaalbare matcha-leveringsprogramma</a> supports cafés, restaurant groups, and hospitality brands operating across multiple locations. We offer consistent grades, reliable lead times, and flexible packaging formats to ensure the same taste, color, and performance at every site.</p>",
    "text": "Ja. Ons schaalbare matcha-leveringsprogramma supports cafés, restaurant groups, and hospitality brands operating across multiple locations. We offer consistent grades, reliable lead times, and flexible packaging formats to ensure the same taste, color, and performance at every site."
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "ea8a1a39-2a44-8ea3-feed-848f29af9a1b",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"text-size-large-4 text-weight-semibold\">Ready to get <span class=\"text-span-47\" data-w-id=\"af4300d8-917e-1505-83d8-8a5101132418\">started</span>?</div>",
    "text": "Ready to get started?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "ea8a1a39-2a44-8ea3-feed-848f29af9a1e",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"text-size-regular\">We're here to help you choose the perfect matcha for your café, coffee shop, gym, or office. Get expert advice tailored to your industry and start serving premium matcha today.</p>",
    "text": "We're here to help you choose the perfect matcha for your café, coffee shop, gym, or office. Get expert advice tailored to your industry and start serving premium matcha today."
   },
